emantic_register/frame_test.cljc\n?? collab/numbering-ref/probe/src/yin/vm/ucf/rows.cljc\n?? collab/numbering-ref/probe/src/yin/vm/ucf/rows_test.cljc\n?? collab/numbering-ref/review-r4.md\nc8d4dca2 docs(yin.vm.ucf): the numbering note records that it is implemented\n23c233ed docs(yin.vm.ucf): the carrier and continuation documents carry the discovery-order numbering (amendments A1 to A9)\na5cf71d6 Merge numbering-note: the discovery-order numbering design\n810fb3c8 Merge master into srvm-phase6a\n19f8a1d2 feat(yin.vm.ucf): cursor cells are numbered by discovery order, sorted sets and maps, a tie test and a refusal (phase 6a)\n7d9d0c08 docs(yin.vm): discovery-order cursor cell numbering, the base design (sorted sets and maps, tie test, refusal), after four codex reviews\n1bb2638c docs(yin.vm): discovery-order numbering note revised after the codex review (component rule, local runs, totality, decode)\n7a6d7cc9 docs(yin.vm): discovery-order numbering for cursor cells (design note)\nd77da9f0 refactor(yin.vm.ucf): the carrier's box is a cursor cell; regenerate the pinned root ids (phase 6a)\n83fd51d8 refactor(yin.vm.ucf): rename the carrier's cell to cursor, regenerate the pinned root ids (phase 6a)\naf2b29c4 fix(yin.vm.ucf): input row bodies do not spend the label-byte budget (phase 6a review)\n6b7e65ed fix(yin.vm.ucf): refuse guest marker shapes in every literal context, tag decoded equality, bound label bytes (phase 6a review)\nbb4a6558 fix(yin.vm.ucf): refuse malformed census keys, installs and marker collisions, and kill the surviving mutants (phase 6a review)\n4b0e735e feat(yin.vm.ucf): the register frame validator and the row codec (phase 6a)\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
